WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.666
In the previous verses, Lord Krishna explained

2
00:00:32.666 --> 00:00:34.333
 that the entire creation

3
00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:36.416
operates under His control.

4
00:00:36.416 --> 00:00:39.000
He Himself is the master of this world.

5
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.666
Hearing this,

6
00:00:40.666 --> 00:00:43.333
a question may arise in your mind –

7
00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:47.625
if Lord Krishna Himself is the master of creation,

8
00:00:47.625 --> 00:00:50.375
why do many people not honour Him?

9
00:00:50.375 --> 00:00:53.333
Why do some consider Him an ordinary human

10
00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:57.083
and fail to understand His greatness?

11
00:00:57.083 --> 00:01:01.416
In this verse, Lord Krishna 
Himself answers this question.

12
00:01:01.416 --> 00:01:03.250
Let’s understand this.

13
00:01:08.333 --> 00:01:11.875
Lord Krishna says – those who are mudha,

14
00:01:11.875 --> 00:01:12.666
meaning

15
00:01:12.666 --> 00:01:15.208
those who have lost their
 vision due to ignorance,

16
00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:17.666
can never understand the divine form

17
00:01:17.666 --> 00:01:19.625
of Lord Krishna.

18
00:01:19.625 --> 00:01:21.083
When Lord Krishna

19
00:01:21.083 --> 00:01:23.041
appears in human form,

20
00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:24.750
they remain unaware

21
00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:26.000
of His divine

22
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:28.333
powers and begin to mock Him.

23
00:01:28.333 --> 00:01:30.458
They see Lord Krishna

24
00:01:30.458 --> 00:01:33.208
as merely an ordinary human being.

25
00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:35.083
They do not realise

26
00:01:35.083 --> 00:01:38.875
that Krishna is the supreme
 controller of all creation.

27
00:01:38.875 --> 00:01:41.541
He is the infinite supreme being,

28
00:01:41.541 --> 00:01:45.208
who pervades everything and is the refuge of all.

29
00:01:45.208 --> 00:01:48.791
And this mistake happens only because

30
00:01:48.791 --> 00:01:50.875
they see through a material lens,

31
00:01:50.875 --> 00:01:53.000
not a spiritual one.

32
00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.666
Their intellect assumes that if Krishna

33
00:01:55.666 --> 00:01:56.958
were to appear,

34
00:01:56.958 --> 00:01:57.958
He would not come

35
00:01:57.958 --> 00:01:59.458
as an ordinary human,

36
00:01:59.458 --> 00:02:03.000
but in some grand, otherworldly form.

37
00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:06.083
They do not know that Krishna's human form

38
00:02:06.083 --> 00:02:09.208
is not mortal, but eternal,

39
00:02:09.208 --> 00:02:13.083
conscious, and full of bliss.

40
00:02:13.083 --> 00:02:15.166
Now hearing this, some may have

41
00:02:15.166 --> 00:02:17.375
this confusion arise in their minds –

42
00:02:17.375 --> 00:02:18.833
if Lord Krishna

43
00:02:18.833 --> 00:02:20.666
appears in human form,

44
00:02:20.666 --> 00:02:23.250
then what is His true nature?

45
00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:26.458
But the truth is that Lord Krishna

46
00:02:26.458 --> 00:02:27.958
is not made in our image –

47
00:02:27.958 --> 00:02:31.208
rather, we are made in His image.

48
00:02:31.208 --> 00:02:33.916
He created us in His own likeness,

49
00:02:33.916 --> 00:02:36.083
yet out of ignorance, some see Him

50
00:02:36.083 --> 00:02:39.083
only as an impressive person

51
00:02:39.083 --> 00:02:42.083
or a character described in history,

52
00:02:42.083 --> 00:02:43.125
while others

53
00:02:43.125 --> 00:02:44.458
see Him merely

54
00:02:44.458 --> 00:02:47.208
as a symbol of some formless principle.

55
00:02:47.208 --> 00:02:47.916
But

56
00:02:47.916 --> 00:02:50.083
they fail to recognise

57
00:02:50.083 --> 00:02:53.166
His true nature, which is sat-chit-ananda –

58
00:02:53.166 --> 00:02:57.208
eternal, everlasting, full of knowledge.

59
00:02:57.208 --> 00:03:00.000
Let alone ordinary humans.

60
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:03.583
Even Brahma, the first architect of creation,

61
00:03:03.583 --> 00:03:07.416
was bewildered watching Lord Krishna's

62
00:03:07.416 --> 00:03:08.875
childhood pastimes.

63
00:03:08.875 --> 00:03:10.791
But when he directly

64
00:03:10.791 --> 00:03:14.208
experienced the Lord's divine glory, only then

65
00:03:14.208 --> 00:03:15.208
could he truly

66
00:03:15.208 --> 00:03:18.166
understand Lord Krishna's supreme form.

67
00:03:18.166 --> 00:03:20.541
So through this verse,

68
00:03:20.541 --> 00:03:22.166
we must understand

69
00:03:22.166 --> 00:03:23.666
that we must see Lord Krishna

70
00:03:23.666 --> 00:03:25.166
not through a material lens,

71
00:03:25.166 --> 00:03:26.458
but through the eye

72
00:03:26.458 --> 00:03:28.708
of spiritual knowledge.

73
00:03:28.708 --> 00:03:30.750
He is beautiful and simple,

74
00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:32.541
yet within His simplicity

75
00:03:32.541 --> 00:03:34.791
lies His infinite nature.

76
00:03:34.791 --> 00:03:36.416
And when we understand

77
00:03:36.416 --> 00:03:38.583
this divine form of Lord Krishna,

78
00:03:38.583 --> 00:03:42.458
we can break free from the bondage

79
00:03:42.458 --> 00:03:43.708
of this material world

80
00:03:43.708 --> 00:03:47.666
and taste the joy of true liberation.

81
00:03:52.583 --> 00:03:54.958
When I

82
00:03:54.958 --> 00:03:57.333
Myself descend to this earth

83
00:03:57.333 --> 00:04:00.500
in human form,

84
00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:02.750
many people

85
00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:07.041
cannot understand My eternal nature.

86
00:04:07.041 --> 00:04:09.750
To them,

87
00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:11.291
I appear

88
00:04:11.291 --> 00:04:14.750
only as a human being.

89
00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:18.416
They mistake Me for a limited

90
00:04:18.416 --> 00:04:22.291
being like themselves.

91
00:04:22.291 --> 00:04:24.000
But

92
00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:27.333
why does this happen?

93
00:04:27.333 --> 00:04:29.750
It happens because

94
00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:31.500
they only

95
00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:36.916
observe My outer form.

96
00:04:36.916 --> 00:04:38.125
Perhaps

97
00:04:38.125 --> 00:04:41.041
the same happens in your life too.

98
00:04:41.041 --> 00:04:44.208
When you look at yourself, at other

99
00:04:44.208 --> 00:04:46.791
people, at situations

100
00:04:46.791 --> 00:04:49.541
only from the outside,

101
00:04:49.541 --> 00:04:52.500
you miss the vastness

102
00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:55.208
and depth hidden within.

103
00:04:55.208 --> 00:04:59.750
But behind every situation and every person,

104
00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:02.541
deeper truths are concealed,

105
00:05:02.541 --> 00:05:05.250
which are essential to understand.

106
00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:08.458
If you want to reach the right conclusions,

107
00:05:08.458 --> 00:05:10.583
then just as

108
00:05:10.583 --> 00:05:14.375
understanding My eternal nature

109
00:05:14.375 --> 00:05:17.375
requires you to see with a spiritual

110
00:05:17.375 --> 00:05:20.291
perspective, in the same way,

111
00:05:20.291 --> 00:05:23.833
the events that occur in your life

112
00:05:23.833 --> 00:05:28.041
or the people who come into your contact

113
00:05:28.041 --> 00:05:30.958
also carry within them unseen possibilities

114
00:05:30.958 --> 00:05:34.041
and hidden qualities.

115
00:05:34.041 --> 00:05:35.875
You simply need to look at them

116
00:05:35.875 --> 00:05:38.375
with humility, deeply,

117
00:05:38.375 --> 00:05:39.958
and understand them.

118
00:05:39.958 --> 00:05:43.333
If you learn to see with the heart,

119
00:05:43.333 --> 00:05:45.833
let go of your assumptions,

120
00:05:45.833 --> 00:05:48.250
and go deeper,

121
00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:51.291
life will surely offer you new meaning,

122
00:05:51.291 --> 00:05:54.750
new treasures.

123
00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:58.666
Always remember, just as

124
00:05:58.666 --> 00:06:02.833
My cowherd form held within its simplicity

125
00:06:02.833 --> 00:06:06.875
maya, infinite boundless power,

126
00:06:06.875 --> 00:06:10.208
in the same way, your life too

127
00:06:10.208 --> 00:06:13.208
holds many deep meanings.

128
00:06:13.208 --> 00:06:18.208
You will discover many 
extraordinary dimensions of life.

129
00:06:18.208 --> 00:06:21.041
You only need a new way

130
00:06:21.041 --> 00:06:24.083
of seeing.

131
00:06:24.083 --> 00:06:25.500
That's all.

132
00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:32.541
In this world,

133
00:06:32.541 --> 00:06:36.541
when I Myself was not understood,

134
00:06:36.541 --> 00:06:42.083
even as God, people could not recognise Me,

135
00:06:42.083 --> 00:06:43.500
then how

136
00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.916
can you expect

137
00:06:45.916 --> 00:06:50.250
that everyone will understand your feelings,

138
00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:54.500
your pain, your silence?

139
00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:58.000
It will not happen, my friend.

140
00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:02.750
free yourself from this expectation first.

141
00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:07.500
Even those closest to you

142
00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:11.750
may sometimes misunderstand you.

143
00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:13.791
Sometimes your silence

144
00:07:13.791 --> 00:07:17.000
may be interpreted differently,

145
00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:20.666
sometimes your efforts may go unnoticed.

146
00:07:20.666 --> 00:07:25.458
But you should not be disturbed by this,

147
00:07:25.458 --> 00:07:29.125
nor should you be anxious.

148
00:07:29.125 --> 00:07:32.875
Just as I am not disturbed.

149
00:07:32.875 --> 00:07:35.333
Let go of the attachment

150
00:07:35.333 --> 00:07:38.666
of expecting others to understand you.

151
00:07:38.666 --> 00:07:41.833
Simply with humility,

152
00:07:41.833 --> 00:07:45.541
remain steadfast on the path of truth.

153
00:07:45.541 --> 00:07:48.958
Do what is right,

154
00:07:48.958 --> 00:07:52.166
and in all things, keep love,

155
00:07:52.166 --> 00:07:54.958
patience, and compassion.

156
00:07:54.958 --> 00:07:58.708
Let go of ego and resentment –

157
00:07:58.708 --> 00:08:01.041
love everyone.

158
00:08:01.041 --> 00:08:02.541
This will bring

159
00:08:02.541 --> 00:08:05.791
depth, simplicity,

160
00:08:05.791 --> 00:08:08.333
and steadiness to your relationships,

161
00:08:08.333 --> 00:08:12.416
and this is also the path to a happy

162
00:08:12.416 --> 00:08:16.000
and flourishing family.

163
00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:24.125
When I Myself,

164
00:08:24.125 --> 00:08:27.708
Lord Krishna,

165
00:08:27.708 --> 00:08:30.791
go among ordinary people

166
00:08:30.791 --> 00:08:34.000
in a simple form,

167
00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:39.500
some consider Me ordinary too.

168
00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:43.708
They are unaware of who I truly am.

169
00:08:43.708 --> 00:08:48.416
In the same way, when in your workplace

170
00:08:48.416 --> 00:08:52.041
you stand humbly among everyone,

171
00:08:52.041 --> 00:08:55.083
helping others,

172
00:08:55.083 --> 00:08:56.458
some people

173
00:08:56.458 --> 00:09:01.166
may mistake your humility for weakness.

174
00:09:01.166 --> 00:09:04.583
That is why it is important

175
00:09:04.583 --> 00:09:07.708
that when you make yourself available

176
00:09:07.708 --> 00:09:10.875
to help someone with warmth,

177
00:09:10.875 --> 00:09:13.875
you maintain a balance

178
00:09:13.875 --> 00:09:16.166
between your boundaries

179
00:09:16.166 --> 00:09:20.666
and warmth, and this balance

180
00:09:20.666 --> 00:09:24.708
is the mark of true leadership.

181
00:09:24.708 --> 00:09:27.875
Help others, by all means.

182
00:09:27.875 --> 00:09:33.416
But maintain the dignity of your role.

183
00:09:33.416 --> 00:09:34.583
Your humility

184
00:09:34.583 --> 00:09:37.625
must also be backed by firmness.

185
00:09:37.625 --> 00:09:39.500
Just as I

186
00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:43.041
am a child in My pastimes,

187
00:09:43.041 --> 00:09:46.291
yet also the Lord of the universe,

188
00:09:46.291 --> 00:09:47.666
in the same way,

189
00:09:47.666 --> 00:09:52.916
be warm and approachable in your role, but

190
00:09:52.916 --> 00:09:55.500
never lose your confidence,

191
00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:58.791
your experience, and your authority,

192
00:09:58.791 --> 00:10:01.791
so that people come to you

193
00:10:01.791 --> 00:10:05.750
and also respect you.

194
00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:08.166
This is what successful leadership is.
